Z||000005||Shaun41178||01-29-2001||04:38 PM||||could be an ignition problem, like wires or a coil pack.  i doubt the tranny has anything to do with it but it is possible.  Fuel problem maybe or timing problem.  check the TPS switch.  i know that when mine is stuck in the WOT position it stumbles on takeoff and is normal after that.  make sure it is not stuck.  Check the timing too.<P>You need to provide us with more info.  specific details<P>------------------<BR>Shaun 85 GT with nitrous<BR>0-60 in 5.6 seconds<BR><A HREF="http://members.aol.com/Shaun41178" TARGET=_blank>Preferred Performance</A>||||reg||1
